# When do JEPAs collapse? — ICLR 2027 submission (extension)

Delivery root of the paper. Status: **ported to the ICLR 2027 template; extension in progress** (objective #12). The delivered NeurIPS 2026 paper (released at 6e496ca) is now built in the official ICLR 2027 kit (`iclr2027_conference.sty/.bst`, unmodified, submission mode), with the NeurIPS checklist replaced by the ICLR ethics, reproducibility and (required) AI use statements; main text ends on page 9, venue checker (venue-repo ff2c250) PASS. The extension's new sections, contributions and abstract follow the study plan (story-repo `plan.md`) once its results arrive.

