## Build

From the delivery root (TeX Live 2026, pdflatex):

```
python3 paper/tools/make_numbers.py            # regenerate paper/numbers.tex from results/
cd paper && latexmk -pdf -interaction=nonstopmode -halt-on-error main.tex
```

Venue conformance: `python3 tools/check_submission.py paper/main.pdf paper` (ICLR 2027 checker from venue-repo).

The claim → evidence map (each claim, the figure/table showing it, and the code and result files it rests on) is `paper/CLAIMS.md`. What the extension retains, revises and adds relative to the released NeurIPS 2026 paper (6e496ca) is `paper/CHANGES.md`.
